# An eggshell in cola: test the acid that is actually represented
# Cola's phosphoric acid meets carbonate chalk. Membrane, enamel, osmosis,
# surface texture and a whole egg are not represented.
register lv1
add v1 cola 100mL
measure v1 ph
add v1 chalk_stick 2g
look v1
measure v1 ph
new beaker
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 chalk_stick 2g
look v2
